      "id": "claim_2ac65521543c47e09ea08f605618d906",
      "statement": "github.com/smallstep/cli builds the step binary, a PKI CLI that works standalone and as a client of the step-ca online CA; the module is pure Go (CGO_ENABLED=0 in Makefile and release builds) targeting Go 1.25.8 per go.mod.",
