    {
      "id": "claim_ba71d1d808dc41a2939cdc1cb5b98e26",
      "statement": "Layer 2 (runtime shell): internal/cmd/root.go owns the urfave/cli app lifecycle — step.Init environment setup, app construction with overridden help/flag formatting, dispatch to registered commands or plugins, and error/panic presentation — and contains no PKI logic itself.",
