      "statement": "Layer 3: the command/ tree contains one package per command group (ca, certificate, crypto, ssh, oauth, context, api, crl, plus small utilities) that parse flags, prompt, print, and delegate; the contributor guide directs hierarchy levels into their own packages and cross-command functionality into top-level packages like flags.",
