      "id": "claim_a41d07695b124d26ad63c241dae233c9",
      "statement": "Layer 4 (shared engines): utils/cautils holds the CA client flows (NewTokenFlow provisioner dispatch, CertificateFlow, OfflineCA, bootstrap, ACME), token/ defines the JWT claim model, flags/ defines shared flag definitions, and internal/ holds internal helpers (cryptoutil, sshutil, kdf, crlutil, plugin, context injection); dependency direction is one-way from command groups to flows to external modules — flows never import command packages.",
